      "narrative": null,
      "content": "Several years have passed since the launch of the National Health Workforce Accounts (NHWA) \nin 2017. And following a global pandemic that disrupted healthcare services worldwide, it is \nan opportune time to reflect on the progress, priorities, gaps, and adaptations of the NHWA. \nThe NHWA has witnessed unprecedented engagement from countries, partners, and all three \nlevels of the World Health Organization, with focal points nominated by most Member States \n(90%).\nThanks to collective efforts, there has been a significant improvement in the availability and \nquality of health workforce (HWF) d",
